@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/memories

### 1. GET semua memori
GET {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1

### 2. POST tambah memori 1 (Identitas)
POST {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "identity",
  "factText": "Nama panggilan pengguna adalah Kaisar.",
  "importance": 5,
  "isActive": true
}

### 3. POST tambah memori 2 (Kuliah)
POST {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "study",
  "factText": "Pengguna sedang mengerjakan tugas 10 NestJS PostgreSQL dan Prisma ORM.",
  "importance": 5,
  "isActive": true
}

### 4. POST tambah memori 3 (Hobi)
POST {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "hobby",
  "factText": "Pengguna menyukai anime Detective Conan.",
  "importance": 3,
  "isActive": true
}

### 5. GET memori berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/MEM-01 HTTP/1.1

### 6. PATCH ubah memori
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/MEM-01 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "importance": 4,
  "factText": "Nama panggilan pengguna adalah Kaisar (Updated di PostgreSQL)"
}

### 7. GET statistik & filter lanjutan (Nilai Tambah - Poin 6)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats HTTP/1.1

### 8. GET statistik dengan filter kategori & prioritas (where + count)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats?category=study&minImportance=4 HTTP/1.1

### 9. DELETE memori berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/MEM-03 HTTP/1.1

### 10. ERROR SCENARIO 1: Validasi DTO (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "invalid_category",
  "factText": "Tes",
  "importance": 99
}

### 11. ERROR SCENARIO 2: ID tidak ditemukan (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/MEM-999 HTTP/1.1

### 12. ERROR SCENARIO 3: Duplikat fakta (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "study",
  "factText": "Pengguna sedang mengerjakan tugas 10 NestJS PostgreSQL dan Prisma ORM.",
  "importance": 5
}
